'''The Harborage''' is a small [[draenei]] village inhabited by the [[Tribe of Sanv]], a group of draenei exiles who managed to stay sane after crossing over to the world of [[Azeroth]] from [[Draenor]]. It is located in the northern part of the [[Swamp of Sorrows]]. The draenei here are led by [[Sanv K'la]].

